1053 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 213 0 R
/E (**Q: Can I drink alcohol and still lose weight?**)
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
1054 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 213 0 R
/E (A: Yes, in moderation. Alcohol has 7 calories per gram \(almost as much as fat\). Limit to 1-2 drinks, choose lower-calorie options \(vodka soda, light beer\), and account for it in your daily intake.)
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
1055 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 213 0 R
/E (**Q: Do I need to eat breakfast?**)
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
1056 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 213 0 R
/E (A: Not if you're not hungry. Meal timing is flexible. What matters is total daily intake and finding a pattern that helps you control hunger. Some people do better with intermittent fasting; others need breakfast to avoid overeating later.)
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
1057 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 213 0 R
/E (**Q: How do I handle hunger?**)
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
1058 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 213 0 R
/E (A: First, make sure you're eating enough protein \(0.7-1g/lb\) and fiber \(25-35g\). Add more vegetables \(volume without many calories\). Drink water. If you're still hungry after 2 weeks, increase calories by 100-200/day.)
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
1059 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 213 0 R
/E (**Q: Can I build muscle and lose fat at the same time?**)
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
1060 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 213 0 R
/E (A: Yes, if you're new to training, returning after a break, or have higher body fat. Prioritize protein \(1g/lb\), strength train 3-4x/week, and eat at a small deficit \(200-300 calories\) or maintenance.)
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
1061 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 213 0 R
/E (**Q: What if I don't like cooking?**)
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
1062 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 213 0 R
/E (A: Focus on simple meals: protein + vegetable + carb. Use shortcuts: rotisserie chicken, pre-cut vegetables, frozen meals \(choose high-protein, lower-calorie options\), meal delivery services, or batch cook once a week.)
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
1063 0 obj
<<
