/Title (**Q: How do I maintain after reaching my goal?** A: Gradually increase calories by 100-200/week until weight stabilizes. Keep tracking for 2-4 weeks to find your maintenance. Continue habits you've built \(protein intake, vegetable consumption, regular movement\). Weigh weekly; if you gain 5+ lbs, return to a small deficit.)
